  "description": "Ko I-Deum is a total shut in who knows how to do one thing, and one thing only: write passionate BL smut. There’s just one small problem: I-Deum is a complete and total virgin. To try and stimulate his brain (among other things), I-Deum takes to…well, “taking care of himself” in front of the window, imagining all sorts of sensual scenarios to jumpstart his creative juices. Sure, there may be an apartment right across from him, but nobody’s lived there for years…until now! Mid self-love session, he looks up to see a man staring at him from across the street - and not just any man, but the bisexual icon and surely soon-to-be celeb, acting major Kwon Jae-Yi. Some might say their situation is a little too close for comfort…but maybe it’s just the right distance for something more.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
